    {
      "id": "apply-on-the-left",
      "name": "applyOnTheLeft",
      "category": "Jacobi",
      "signature": "applyOnTheLeft(P, Q, J)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "P",
          "type": "Index"
        },
        {
          "name": "Q",
          "type": "Index"
        },
        {
          "name": "J",
          "type": "JacobiRotation<OtherScalar>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<Derived> template<OtherScalar> EIGEN_DEVICE_FUNC void MatrixBase<Derived",
      "docs": "\\jacobi_module\nApplies the rotation in the plane \\a j to the rows \\a p and \\a q of \\c *this, i.e., it computes B = J * B,\nwith \\f$ B = \\left ( \\begin{array}{cc} \\text{*this.row}(p) \\\\ \\text{*this.row}(q) \\end{array} \\right ) \\f$.\n\\sa class JacobiRotation, MatrixBase::applyOnTheRight(), internal::apply_rotation_in_the_plane()"
    },
    {
      "id": "apply-on-the-right",
      "name": "applyOnTheRight",
      "category": "Jacobi",
      "signature": "applyOnTheRight(P, Q, J)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "P",
          "type": "Index"
        },
        {
          "name": "Q",
          "type": "Index"
        },
        {
          "name": "J",
          "type": "JacobiRotation<OtherScalar>&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<Derived> template<OtherScalar> EIGEN_DEVICE_FUNC void MatrixBase<Derived",
      "docs": "\\ingroup Jacobi_Module\nApplies the rotation in the plane \\a j to the columns \\a p and \\a q of \\c *this, i.e., it computes B = B * J\nwith \\f$ B = \\left ( \\begin{array}{cc} \\text{*this.col}(p) & \\text{*this.col}(q) \\end{array} \\right ) \\f$.\n\\sa class JacobiRotation, MatrixBase::applyOnTheLeft(), internal::apply_rotation_in_the_plane()"
    },
